  "commit_message": "refactor(api): bundle uploadHandler's params into an uploadDeps struct\n\nuploadHandler took 6 positional constructor params, two of them bools\n(useS3Push, localWritable) that read ambiguously and were easy to\ntranspose by accident at a call site. Reviewer follow-up on #135.\n\nBundles cfg, store, s3Store, pushBucket, and the two storage-routing\nbools into a single uploadDeps struct, with each bool field documented\ninline so its meaning is clear from the struct definition alone. No\nexisting \"Deps\"/\"",
